  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Undertakings-General_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 925d16a46771a2246838ee5b5d0b4a56, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 907393163264
    m_Localized: Fix the big fissure in Blu Valley
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 912300498944
    m_Localized: 'There is a big fissure in Blu Valley blocking everyone from leaving,
      and coming in for that matter. You should try to fix it! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916083761152
    m_Localized: You fixed he big Fissure in Blu Valley! Now everyone can come and
      go as they please!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112341081669558272
    m_Localized: Fix the fissure in Blu Valley when you have enough <sprite name="Agency">
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126181398218858496
    m_Localized: Buy the house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126181862830301184
    m_Localized: There's an abandoned house in the village that could be yours, just
      follow these simple steps! Go to the Village Desk. Have in your inventory 50
      soft wood, 100 stone and 1000 sparks. Live the dream!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126181866785529856
    m_Localized: You sure stepped in it now! That abandoned house is now yours! And
      all the responsibilities that come with it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137736097556389888
    m_Localized: Fix Sculpture Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137739706843062272
    m_Localized: Ok, ok, ok... imagine what mechanics get unlocked by going down
      this rabbit-hole... Is it worth it? I'll let you decide, for you at least,
      but I am warning yxou, just in case you think it isn't worth the effort. I
      do, but you? I don't know you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137740172222062592
    m_Localized: So wait, all 9 areas have been fixed up? Like, you actually put
      the effort in for something that you do not know what it would do? Well, I
      hope you like the reward. I think it's great, but I'm also a biased and awkward
      person, sitting in the dark, creating this whole thing, so I guess I have my
      reasons and sensibilities, but you? You're a hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138508142862983168
    m_Localized: Fix Blu Valley Bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138508147044704256
    m_Localized: While there is a detour, talk about out of the way to get from one
      place to another. Why don't you get this bridge all fixed up and traversable?
      You'd probably (maybe [almost certainly]) be praised for such an endeavor.
      I mean, what have you got to lose, a reputation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138508405149589504
    m_Localized: So, the one actually usefull bridge (don't tell the others) is finally
      passable. Thanks to you there is a straight-forward way to get from Thimbleton
      to Blu Valley, and vice-versa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138508808431919104
    m_Localized: "This seems l\xE9ike an oportune time to go see the mayor in town-hall
      and get this fixed up. Hop to it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138508914623307776
    m_Localized: Fix all the areas that are required, they're here and there, mostly
      there-ish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144312859283218432
    m_Localized: Buy the house at the village desk. Slick should come by and get
      it all fixed-up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159446388656627712
    m_Localized: Fix Column Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159446524363333632
    m_Localized: Fix the column near the graveyard that you stumbled upon. After
      talking to Munnin about it he asked you to fix it. Mayhap that would be a good
      idea?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159446581951127552
    m_Localized: You've fixed the column!! Maybe one day it will be able to do something
      special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159446731415150592
    m_Localized: Fix the column are you found near the graveyard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269991313135226880
    m_Localized: Clear Squonk Junk Piles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269991315203018752
    m_Localized: You did it! You cleared someone else's mess! And now that satisfaction
      is yours. Never shall the instigator of said mess understand the sheer splendor
      in being the one to get rid of it, to remove the burden from others, to own
      responsibility. You, however, have reached nirvana, no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269991317098844160
    m_Localized: Everywhere, as far as the eye can see, JUNK! Well, ok, just over
      here, but still very disturbing! Why don't you clear it up, eh? Come on, be
      a good sport wontcha?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 317166797962727424
    m_Localized: Gather 5 Stones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 317166943387635712
    m_Localized: Gather 5 Weak Sticks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
